{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/weight-loss/rucking-results-what-to-expect","version_id":"0ae0d0a592ed77ea68c9223b5a62c8f9ab03f2ad94f7c9a850674658577efb93","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is a general weight-loss and training article, not evidence about gear suitability for Mammoth; incidental sock, watch, and pack recommendations do not establish that connection. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions and publisher-level GORUCK review units; the newly disclosed correction under Freshness and novelty does not bring the subject into scope.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-mackall-45-first-look","version_id":"a6522fcf14f894e61d358993ad4922c00752c259408b4b70f78d5b1ce0304eac","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty, the review adds specific loaded-walking observations: support and loose-ground grip with a GR1 and 20 lb plate, initial heel blisters, and rubbing that stopped after break-in, supporting Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Commercial incentives and Uncertainty require identifying the gifted GORUCK shoes and affiliate commissions, attributing subjective praise, and noting that distance, long-term durability, and wet-weather performance remain untested; Conflicting evidence supports contrasting the heel experience with GORUCK's ready-out-of-box claim.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-tough-packing-list","version_id":"3106c2de642ea92b7cf63da38dd45508a68ecbd6e72b52dff9d6e785f9f500c5","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Relevance, the hydration, foot care, layers, and load-management topics transfer to Mammoth, but Credibility and Unsupported claims warrant deferral because the guide explicitly relies on specifications and editorial analysis without described testing for its comfort, durability, and product rankings. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions, shop referrals, and publisher-level GORUCK review units; Suitability and official requirements also prevents treating the cited GORUCK Tough list as Mammoth requirements.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/rucking-for-weight-loss-gear-guide","version_id":"075cca7b7d290eef48c929410460f6daa548faa2009d56719ebfb401adddb3bd","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Relevance, packs, socks, hydration, and load stability could inform Mammoth gear choices, but Credibility and Unsupported claims warrant deferral because the recommended kit is explicitly untested as an intervention and its comparative comfort, durability, and blister-reduction claims lack described hands-on evidence. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions, repeated shop and starter-kit referrals, and publisher-level GORUCK review units, which reduce the weight of its product endorsements.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/goruck-labor-day-sale-2026","version_id":"7b116c31175b02094b025a82f3cf6d2b300c9a903c7e2d55437dabe10d57856f","decision":"reject","reason":"Relevance explicitly rejects sales, deals, and discount posts, and Making the decision applies because this item principally directs readers to current markdowns, retailer cards, and purchase terms rather than supplying substantive field-performance evidence. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions and publisher-level GORUCK review units; its corrections about expired promotions do not overcome the exclusion.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/rucking-fitness-trend-2026","version_id":"06a1df5ae4472364410f48fdc0260569502ca36887afc51f46a95c67c1368d18","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, fitness popularity, celebrity advocates, sales growth, and beginner exercise guidance do not establish gear suitability for Mammoth; the incidental pack and shoe suggestions provide no specific field testing. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions and publisher-level GORUCK review units, while Credibility prevents treating GORUCK's reported sales growth or prominent endorsements as performance evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/rucking-for-bone-density","version_id":"586dc303595281ba26e8e1470d2bbd63cbc7482e7806b2810b7d177cbfcdd5ce","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is a bone-health research explainer rather than an evaluation of gear for Mammoth's carried loads, weather, or repeated use. Freshness and novelty recognizes the corrected interpretation and newer studies, but these do not establish event relevance; Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions, equipment referrals, and publisher-level GORUCK review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/guides/rucking-for-mental-health","version_id":"1ac6d2379c4d9d6a74417c5ccbc9f4c88cfee9a8f007563c5b932e571a619ee5","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, the article addresses exercise, outdoor activity, and mental-health support rather than gear performance or practical equipment tradeoffs at Mammoth. Its generic backpack and weight suggestions add no gear-specific testing, and Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions and publisher-level GORUCK review units.","piece_ids":[]}
